+priority (nice)** or config `advanced.ai.faces.videoNice`. Optional
+deploy-time pin: `TGDL_FACES_VIDEO_NICE` on **both** services — but do
+**not** inject compose `:-0`/`:-10` defaults or the UI value is ignored
