+/**
+ * Perceptual hashes for video fingerprints.
+ *
+ * Similar-clips uses PDQ-256 (64×64 luma → 16×16 AC coefficients,
+ * DC skipped per Meta PDQ, 64 hex). Hamming and XOR aggregate work on
